---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const lastUpdated = new Date("2026-09-08");
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Now"
  description="What Ahmed Hossam is working on and learning right now."
>
  <div class="content-shell now-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">Now</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">
        Last updated <time datetime={lastUpdated.toISOString()}>
          September 2026
        </time>
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="now-body">
      <p class="now-intro">
        I work at the Open Transit Software Foundation on
        <a href="https://github.com/OneBusAway" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OneBusAway</a>,
        open source software that helps millions of people navigate public
        transit every day.
      </p>

      <h2>Working on</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/OneBusAway/maglev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Maglev</a>,
          OneBusAway's next-generation server.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/OneBusAway/mcp-server" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OneBusAway MCP</a>.
          More transit data endpoints and a better developer experience.
        </li>
        <li>And much more.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="projects-link">
        You can explore my projects on
        <a href="https://github.com/Ahmedhossamdev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Learning</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Going deeper into AWS services and preparing for AWS certifications,
          starting with the
          <a href="https://www.udemy.com/course/aws-certified-cloud-practitioner-new/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner course</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          Studying LLM engineering through
          <a href="https://www.udemy.com/course/llm-engineering-master-ai-and-large-language-models/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LLM Engineering: Master AI and Large Language Models</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

    </div>

    <p class="now-note">
      This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">/now page</a>.
      It's updated manually.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .now-page {
    padding-block: 3rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .last-updated {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .now-body {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .now-intro {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .now-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--heading);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .now-body ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.375rem;
  }

  .projects-link {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .now-note {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
